  <name>Proplan</name>
  <summary>Project notes and task management</summary>
  <description>
    <p>
      Proplan combines project notes, tasks, timelines, calendars, and realtime Markdown editing in one desktop application.
    </p>
    <p>Features:</p>
    <ul>
      <li>Organize notes, tasks, and timeline entries by project</li>
      <li>Edit content with realtime Markdown rendering</li>
      <li>Review project activity and due work in calendar views</li>
      <li>Keep local and remote images in app-managed storage</li>
    </ul>
  </description>
